   - The mass of each blade is \( m_t = 0.0114 \, \text{kg} \).  
   - The stiffness of each blade is \( k_t = 430,000 \, \text{N/m} \).  
   - The coupling stiffness between blades is \( K_c = 45,430 \, \text{N/m} \).  

2. **Equations of Motion**:  
