   \[
   F \times 0.5 \text{ m} = 0.125 \text{ kg m}^2 \times 4 \text{ rad s}^{-2}
   \]  
   Simplifying:  
   \[
   F = \frac{0.125 \times 4}{0.5} = 0.8 \text{ N}
   \]  

